夫歸老，賜錢二十萬，床帳薦褥，遣殿中醫療疾給藥。後轉光祿大夫，門施行馬。"},{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-033","source_id":"s-jinshu-033-wanglan-family","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-033-wanglan-family","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-033-wanglan-family:p006","quote":"咸寧四年卒，時年七十三，諡曰貞。有六子：裁、基、會、正、彥、琛。"}],"qualifiers":{"source_term":"有六子","lineage":"paternal"},"interpretation_note":"有六子承前段王覽，六名兒子分別記父；未據名單先後推絕對排行，並不排除未列女兒。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null,"context":{"kind":"adjacent_paragraphs","paragraph_ids":["c-jinshu-033-wanglan-family:p005","c-jinshu-033-wanglan-family:p006"]}},{"id":"a-jinshu076-wang-001","subject_person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABDA","predicate":"father","object_person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABD","status":"source_attested","qualifiers":{"source_term":"父正","lineage":"paternal"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-076","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-076-wangyi-family","source_id":"s-jinshu-076-wangyi-family","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-076-wangyi-family:p001","quote":"王廙，字世將，丞相導從弟，而元帝姨弟也。父正，尚書郎。廙少能屬文，多所通涉，工書畫，善音樂、射御、博弈、雜伎。辟太傅掾，轉參軍。豫迎大駕，封武陵縣侯，拜尚書郎，出為濮陽太守。元帝作鎮江左，廙棄郡過江。帝見之大悅，以為司馬。頻守廬江、鄱陽二郡。豫討周馥、杜韜，以功累增封邑，除冠軍將軍，鎮石頭，領丞相軍諮祭酒。王敦啟為甯遠將軍、荊州刺史。"}],"interpretation_note":"按具名原文及本段承接記錄，原稱與身份分存，不補未名生母或絕對排行。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"name_components":[{"person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABD","title":"尚書郎","surname":"王","ming":"正","additional_names":[],"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-033","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-033-wanglan-family","source_id":"s-jinshu-033-wanglan-family","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-033-wanglan-family:p007","quote":"裁字士初，撫軍長史。基字士先，治書御史。會字士和，侍御史。正字士則，尚書郎。彥字士治，中護軍。琛字士瑋，國子祭酒。","note":"姓名與字分開；同一家世單名依王姓傳主及親屬語境暫分，不把字當本名。頂部稱號為辨認用稱，不表示所有時點均有效。","status":"editorial_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"model":null,"zi":"士則"}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-033-wangla